<http://purl.org/spar/mito/Mention> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "\nOriginally: the action of calling to mind or commemorating something in speech or writing.\n    "@en .
_:n04036e4c6f394b2c929659de60f39a2ab3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
<http://purl.org/spar/mito/Mention> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> "\n    :my-mention a mito:Mention ;\n        mito:hasMentioningEntity :my-mentioning-entity ;\n        mito:hasMentionedEntity :my-mentioned-entity ;\n        mito:hasMentionType mito:explicit .\n    " .
